    how=("Abstraction makes it manageable", "Designers describe behaviour in a hardware description language at **register-transfer level**. Tools then translate that description into logic gates, place the gates on the chip, route the wires between them and check that timing, power and manufacturing rules are all met. Each level hides the detail of the one beneath."),
